<section class="ex-note" id="ln-ddx-prognosis">
<h2>5. Lichen Nitidus: Differential Diagnosis &amp; Prognosis（鑑別診斷與預後）</h2>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Most likely</th><th scope="col">Key points（區分重點）</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Lichen planus</td><td>較大、polymorphic，位於 flexural wrist、arms、legs；dermoscopy 見 dotted and linear vessels with whitish lines；highly pruritic；<strong>CD8 lymphocytes predominate</strong>；no granulomatous inflammation or parakeratosis；DIF often positive（immunoglobulin 結合 cytoid bodies、shaggy fibrinogen deposition）</td></tr>
<tr><td>Psoriasis</td><td>Plaques have silvery scale；dermoscopy 見 even dotted vessels throughout with white scale</td></tr>
<tr><td>Verruca plana</td><td>Limited, asymmetric involvement；大小不一；verrucous surface；dermoscopy 見 filiform structures 或 red dots and globular vessels，背景顏色均勻</td></tr>
<tr><td>Keratosis pilaris</td><td>常見於 cheeks、lateral arms、lateral hips；strong atopic diathesis；persistent disease；dermoscopy 見 perifollicular scaling with keratotic plug、peripilar casts、perifollicular erythema；切片沒有 lichenoid 與 granulomatous infiltrate</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">Table 33-3 Differential Diagnosis of Lichen Nitidus，p.557。Consider：lichen spinulosus、papular eczema、follicular atopic dermatitis、frictional lichenoid eruption、molluscum contagiosum、lichen scrofulosorum、lichenoid syphilitic lesions、bowenoid papulosis、sarcoidosis、phrynoderma、lichen amyloidosis、papular mucinosis、Darier disease、type II and IV pityriasis rubra pilaris。</p>
<h3>Prognosis（預後）</h3>
<ul>
<li>通常是 focal、asymptomatic 的 chronic inflammatory reaction，<mark data-q="114-07">最終會 <strong>spontaneously resolve</strong>：<strong class="ex-n">two thirds</strong> of patients 在 <strong class="ex-n">1 year</strong> 內消退</mark>，較少數歷時數年。<span class="ex-ref">p.557</span></li>
<li>Rarely 可能無限期持續；palmoplantar disease 可能病程較慢性；舊病灶消退時新病灶可能持續出現。</li>
<li>癒合後<strong>不留疤痕、不留色素異常</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.557</span></li>
<li>McKee：可在數個月內自行消退，或無限期持續。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.252</span></li>
</ul>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="ln-treatment">
<h2>6. Lichen Nitidus: Treatment（治療）</h2>
<ul>
<li><mark data-q="114-07">Lichen nitidus 常 asymptomatic 且 <strong>self-limiting</strong>，<strong>most patients do not require treatment</strong></mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.558</span></li>
<li>可能需要治療的情況：protracted pruritus（<strong class="ex-n">&lt;5%</strong> of all cases）、generalized pattern、cosmetically sensitive areas 的病灶。</li>
<li>多數病例適合 topical therapy：<strong>mid- to high-potency topical corticosteroids</strong> 為 first-line topical；<strong>tacrolimus ointment</strong> 在身體為 second-line，在 <strong>face 與 intertriginous</strong> 為 first-line。<span class="ex-ref">p.558</span></li>
<li>PUVA 曾成功用於 generalized 與 palmar disease，但已大多被較安全且有效的 <strong>narrowband UVB</strong> 取代。</li>
<li>Pruritus：oral antihistamines 為 first-line systemic agent（文獻報告 astemizole；diphenhydramine 等 sedating 或 fexofenadine、cetirizine、loratadine 等 nonsedating 可替代）。</li>
<li>Antihistamines 以外的 systemic treatments rarely indicated，保留給較有症狀或外觀嚴重的病例；一般採類似 lichen planus（ch32）的策略：aggressive／atypical disease 針對 lymphocytes（prednisone 或 low-dose cyclosporine），特定亞型用較安全、較不針對性的治療（e.g. hyperkeratotic palmar disease 用 acitretin）。<span class="ex-ref">p.558</span></li>
<li>Short course low-dose oral glucocorticoids（prednisone <strong class="ex-n">0.3 mg/kg</strong>）可能加速 extensive、generalized 或 symptomatic disease 消退；與 topical steroids 或 phototherapy 等 skin-directed therapy 合併時最成功。</li>
<li>其他療法需謹慎，治療的潛在傷害要與 LN 相對良性的本質權衡：antituberculous medications（一例兒童 PPD 陽性）、low-molecular-weight heparin、low-dose cyclosporine（合併 atopic dermatitis）、oral itraconazole。<span class="ex-ref">p.558</span></li>
<li>未來可考慮（依機轉）：明顯 granuloma 形成者用 TNF-α inhibitors；lichenoid infiltrate 較明顯的 severe、refractory 病例用 methotrexate、mycophenolate mofetil、azathioprine、JAK inhibitors。<span class="ex-ref">p.558</span></li>
</ul>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Line</th><th scope="col">Topical</th><th scope="col">Physical</th><th scope="col">Systemic</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>First-line</td><td>Topical steroids；Sun protection（actinic）</td><td>Narrowband UVB（generalized）</td><td>Antihistamines（pruritus）</td></tr>
<tr><td>Second-line</td><td>Topical tacrolimus（face 或 intertriginous areas 為 first-line，其他部位為 second-line）</td><td>UVA and UVB（generalized）；Local PUVA（palmar）</td><td>Oral steroids <strong class="ex-n">0.3 mg/kg/day</strong>（generalized and symptomatic）；Oral retinoids（acitretin）（palmar）；Low-dose cyclosporine <strong class="ex-n">4 mg/kg/day</strong>（generalized and symptomatic）</td></tr>
<tr><td>Third-line</td><td>—</td><td>PUVA（generalized）</td><td>Itraconazole（generalized）；Antituberculous agents（isoniazid）（positive PPD result）；Enoxaparin（generalized）</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">Table 33-4 Treatment of Lichen Nitidus，p.558。</p>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="ls-epi-etiology">
<h2>7. Lichen Striatus: Epidemiology &amp; Pathogenesis（流行病學與致病機轉）</h2>
<h3>Epidemiology</h3>
<ul>
<li>1898 年由 Balzer 與 Mercier 首次描述為「lichenoid trophoneurosis」。<span class="ex-ref">p.559</span></li>
<li>Rare、idiopathic、linear dermatosis；最常侵犯 <strong class="ex-n">&lt;18 歲</strong>，平均發病年齡 <strong class="ex-n">3–5 years</strong>。真正 incidence 與 prevalence 不明。</li>
<li>Self-limited；女性多（<strong class="ex-n">2–3:1</strong>），最常發生在 limbs。<span class="ex-ref">p.559</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="111-33,113-44">最多 <strong class="ex-n">60%</strong>（up to 60%）病人有個人或家族 <strong>atopy</strong> 病史</mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.559</span></li>
<li>McKee：uncommon、通常無症狀；female predominance（<strong class="ex-n">2–3:1</strong>）；任何年齡都可能，但最常見於 <strong class="ex-n">5–15 歲</strong>兒童；成人罕見（adult Blaschkitis）；孕期發生 very rare；家族史罕見；<mark data-q="111-33,113-44">與 atopy 相關者最多 <strong class="ex-n">60%</strong></mark>。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.255</span></li>
</ul>
<aside class="ex-trap"><strong>易錯</strong>好發年齡兩書寫法不同：Fitzpatrick 寫 mean age of onset 3–5 years（p.559），McKee 寫 most often 5–15 years（McKee p.255）。</aside>
<h3>Etiology and pathogenesis</h3>
<ul>
<li>病因未完全了解；<strong>Blaschko-linear pattern 提示 somatic mosaicism</strong>：keratinocytes 的 postzygotic somatic mutations 可能產生 altered antigens，沿 Blaschko lines 分布並可能觸發免疫反應。<span class="ex-ref">p.559</span></li>
<li>對這些 endogenous autoantigens 會發展 immune tolerance；external precipitants 被認為與失去 tolerance 有關。可能誘發因子：environmental stressors、drugs（特別是 <strong>interferon</strong>）、vaccines（<strong>BCG</strong>）、viral antigens、hypersensitivity、skin injury。</li>
<li>支持外在誘因：罕見的 related 與 unrelated siblings 同時發病。</li>
<li><strong>Seasonal variation</strong>（spring 與 summer 發病較多、群聚爆發）支持 infective etiology。Linear lichen planus 病灶曾偵測到 herpes virus DNA，但 lichen striatus 尚未找到類似抗原刺激。<span class="ex-ref">p.559</span></li>
<li>McKee：case clustering 與 seasonality 使人考慮環境或感染因素合併異常宿主反應的可能；有人提出分布沿 Blaschko lines 可能反映 postzygotic abnormality（e.g. 影響局部 stem cells 的 somatic mutation）。例外報告包括成人外傷後、solarium、varicella、influenza、hepatitis B 與 BCG vaccine、interferon、etanercept、bee stings。季節上多數系列以春夏為主，但有一大型系列多在冬季。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.255</span></li>
</ul>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="ls-clinical">
<h2>8. Lichen Striatus: Clinical Features（臨床表現）</h2>
<ul>
<li><mark data-q="105-18">Lichen striatus 是 <strong>Blaschko linear acquired inflammatory skin eruption（BLAISE）</strong> 的一種</mark>：<strong>sudden onset</strong>（days to weeks）的 flat-topped、<strong class="ex-n">1–3 mm</strong>、pink、tan 或 hypopigmented papules，呈 linear configuration 或 Blaschkoid distribution。<span class="ex-ref">p.559</span></li>
<li>個別病灶可能有 scale；曾報告 bilateral 與 parallel eruptions。</li>
<li><mark data-q="111-33">Pruritus 見於 <strong class="ex-n">5%–34%</strong>，在 <strong>atopic individuals 與 adults</strong> 較常見</mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.559</span></li>
<li>部位：extremities <strong class="ex-n">75%–77%</strong>、trunk <strong class="ex-n">9%–21%</strong>；較少見 face <strong class="ex-n">3%–13%</strong>、nails <strong class="ex-n">2.6%</strong>。</li>
<li><mark data-q="111-33"><strong>More extensive disease is seen in adults</strong>，這些病例常似合併 dermatitis</mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.559</span></li>
<li>Nail involvement uncommon：可能造成 longitudinal ridging、onycholysis、splitting、fraying、nail plate loss；治療後指甲變化 tend to be reversible。<span class="ex-ref">p.559</span></li>
<li>McKee：侵犯 limbs 或 neck，病灶通常 solitary、unilateral，紅色或膚色 lichenoid（有時 psoriasiform）scaly papules 融合成連續或斷續的線狀或彎曲帶狀，寬 <strong class="ex-n">1–3 cm</strong>，常沿整條上肢或下肢。偶有多發或雙側。<strong>Not associated with Koebner phenomenon</strong>。消退後有時出現 hypo- 或 hyperpigmentation，在深膚色者可能明顯。Infrequently pruritic；通常數月到一年內消失。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.255</span></li>
<li>McKee（nail）：nail lichen striatus rare 但可能被低報；主要見於兒童與年輕成人，通常單一指甲，呈 median 或 asymmetrical 的 longitudinal lichenoid nail plate dystrophy；上肢多於下肢；指甲變化可能先於皮膚病灶或單獨出現；自發消退（median <strong class="ex-n">22.6 months</strong>）是常態。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.1138</span></li>
</ul>
<aside class="ex-trap"><strong>易錯</strong>Fitzpatrick：pruritus 5%–34%，atopic 與 adults 較常見（p.559）；McKee：infrequently pruritic、pruritus is rare in lichen striatus（McKee p.255、p.257）。</aside>
<p>Ch108 另有 lichen striatus 段落，differential diagnosis 列有 ILVEN <span class="ex-ref">p.1802–1804（ch108）</span>；ILVEN（keratinocytic epidermal nevus 的變異，臨床呈 psoriasiform，可能 very pruritic）另見 <span class="ex-ref">p.1807（ch108）</span>。注意 ch108 的 AT-A-GLANCE 寫 LS usually resolves in 1 to 2 years <span class="ex-ref">p.1802（ch108）</span>，內文寫 most commonly affects children and adolescents 5 to 15 years of age <span class="ex-ref">p.1803（ch108）</span>，與本章 6–12 months、mean onset 3–5 years 寫法不同。</p>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="ls-pathology">
<h2>9. Lichen Striatus: Pathology（病理）</h2>
<h3>Fitzpatrick</h3>
<ul>
<li>組織變化多樣；切片很少做（<strong class="ex-n">10%</strong> of cases）。<span class="ex-ref">p.559</span></li>
<li>Classic findings：hyperkeratosis、focal parakeratosis、mild spongiosis 合併 lichenoid tissue reaction 與 exocytosis、keratinocyte necrosis、<strong>perivascular 與 appendageal lymphocytic infiltrate</strong>（Fig. 33-8C：perieccrine lymphocytic infiltrate）。<span class="ex-ref">p.559–560</span></li>
<li><strong>Superficial lichenoid dermatitis 與 deep lymphocytic infiltrate</strong> 幾乎見於所有病例；早期與晚期病灶較常是非特異性變化。<span class="ex-ref">p.559</span></li>
<li>Histologic mimickers：lichen planus、lupus erythematosus、GVHD、lichen planopilaris、mycosis fungoides、syphilis、atypical dermatitis。</li>
<li>Langerhans cells 整體減少；但含 Langerhans cells 與 T lymphocytes 的 intraepidermal vesicles 可見於 <strong class="ex-n">23%–45%</strong>。臨床實務上 vesicles 很少見，表示 atypical cases 較可能被切片。</li>
<li>Plasma cells、eosinophils、multinucleate giant cells 分別見於 <strong class="ex-n">22%</strong>、<strong class="ex-n">19%</strong>、<strong class="ex-n">2%</strong>。</li>
<li><mark data-q="113-44"><strong>CD8 cells</strong> 是 <strong>DEJ</strong> 的主要浸潤細胞；<strong>CD4 cells</strong> 位於 dermis 與 perivascular area</mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.559</span></li>
<li>Dermal macrophages 常見；colloid bodies 可見於最多一半病例。<span class="ex-ref">p.559</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>McKee 補充</h3>
<ul>
<li>可能只是非特異性的 mild chronic dermatitis；established lesion 常為 <strong>spongiotic dermatitis 合併 lichenoid 與 interface</strong> 變化：parakeratosis、正常或輕度 acanthotic 表皮、intercellular edema、lymphocytic exocytosis、keratinocyte necrosis。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.255</span></li>
<li>有時可見 satellite cell necrosis；偶有 transepidermal elimination of keratinocyte debris（perforating lichen striatus）；intraepidermal Langerhans cell vesicles 極少見（exceptionally）。</li>
<li>Superficial dermis 有 heavy lymphohistiocytic infiltrate，並環繞 superficial 與 deep vascular plexuses，有時也環繞 adnexae（perieccrine）。Eosinophils 與 plasma cells uncommon。</li>
<li>部分切片可能與 lichen planus 無法區分；有 follicular involvement 時可類似 lichen planopilaris；old lesions 有時類似 lichen nitidus。</li>
<li>IHC：<mark data-q="113-44">intraepidermal lymphocytes 多數為 <strong>CD8+ cytotoxic phenotype</strong>；dermal lymphocytes 為 CD4+ 與 CD8+ 混合</mark>；CD7 通常保留；intraepidermal Langerhans cells 可正常、增加或減少。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.255</span></li>
<li>Immunofluorescence 與 lichen planus 相似：IgM（較少 IgG）沉積勾勒 cytoid bodies。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.255</span></li>
<li>Nail biopsy：PNF、nail bed、nail matrix dermis 有中等密度 bandlike lymphohistiocytic infiltrate，伴 exocytosis、slight spongiosis、focal hypergranulosis、dyskeratotic cells。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.1138</span></li>
</ul>
<aside class="ex-trap"><strong>易錯</strong>Lichen striatus 是 CD8 在 DEJ、CD4 在真皮與血管周圍（p.559）；lichen nitidus 則是 CD4+ 多於 CD8+（p.557）。McKee 寫 LS 的 dermal lymphocytes 為 CD4+ 與 CD8+ 混合（McKee p.255）。</aside>
<aside class="ex-trap"><strong>易錯</strong>兩書數據不同：Fitzpatrick 寫含 Langerhans cells 的 intraepidermal vesicles 見於 23%–45%、plasma cells 22%、eosinophils 19%（p.559）；McKee 寫 intraepidermal Langerhans cell vesicles exceptionally described、eosinophils 與 plasma cells uncommon（McKee p.255）。</aside>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="ls-ddx">
<h2>10. Lichen Striatus: Differential Diagnosis（鑑別診斷）</h2>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Most likely</th><th scope="col">Key points（區分重點）</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Linear lichen planus</td><td>Patients are older；primary lesion 較 violaceous，可能有其他部位病灶；highly pruritic；brisk lichenoid tissue reaction，<strong>沒有 periadnexal 或 perieccrine involvement</strong>；DIF often positive（immunoglobulin 結合 cytoid bodies、shaggy fibrinogen deposition）</td></tr>
<tr><td><mark data-q="105-18">Inflammatory linear verrucous epidermal nevus（ILVEN）</mark></td><td>Occurs in children；臨床似 psoriasis；highly pruritic；most resolve by adulthood；組織為 psoriasiform changes，ortho- 與 parakeratosis 交替</td></tr>
<tr><td>Blaschkitis</td><td>Patients are older；papular eruption，傾向 truncal，有多條 streaks；often 有 concomitant dermatitis 特徵；often 在 days to weeks 內消退；relapse 常見（原文印作「Relapse if common」）</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">Table 33-5 Differential Diagnosis of Lichen Striatus，p.561。Consider：linear psoriasis、linear Darier disease、linear porokeratosis、linear lichen nitidus、incontinentia pigmenti。</p>
<ul>
<li>McKee（adult Blaschkitis）：rare、relapsing linear eruption，mean age of onset <strong class="ex-n">40 years</strong>，以男性為主；pruritic papules 與 vesicles，侵犯多處（尤其 trunk），通常數天到數週消退，之後數月到數年反覆。組織以 spongiotic 變化為主，常合併 focal interface inflammation；lichenoid features rare，深部 adnexal involvement 不常見。曾有人認為與 lichen striatus 沒有必要區分，但臨床上有 vesicles、truncal 分布、較快消退、典型 relapsing 病程等不同。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.256–257</span></li>
</ul>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="ls-prognosis-treatment">
<h2>11. Lichen Striatus: Prognosis &amp; Treatment（預後與治療）</h2>
<ul>
<li><mark data-q="114-07">Lichen striatus 是 <strong>self-limited disease</strong>，mean duration 約 <strong class="ex-n">6–12 months</strong>；<strong>relapse is rare</strong></mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.560</span></li>
<li>Postinflammatory hypopigmentation 見於最多 <strong class="ex-n">50%</strong> 病例，但為 self-limited；癒合不留疤痕。</li>
<li><mark data-q="114-07">一般而言 <strong>treatment 與 laboratory testing are not necessary</strong></mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.560</span></li>
<li>症狀性 pruritus：<strong>low- to medium-potency topical steroids</strong> 可作 first-line topical。</li>
<li>Facial involvement 或 topical corticosteroids 無效：topical calcineurin inhibitors（tacrolimus、pimecrolimus）為有效替代；使用最多 <strong class="ex-n">6 weeks</strong> 常有明顯改善。<span class="ex-ref">p.560</span></li>
<li>Nail involvement：topical corticosteroids 與 calcineurin inhibitors 合併 intralesional corticosteroids（triamcinolone <strong class="ex-n">5 mg/mL</strong>）改善 <strong class="ex-n">7 例中 6 例</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.560–561</span></li>
<li>較廣泛的癢或影響睡眠時，oral antihistamines 可能有幫助。<span class="ex-ref">p.561</span></li>
<li>McKee：self-limiting，通常在發病後數月到一年內消失。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.255</span></li>
</ul>
</section>
